      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Beating clothes"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "保罗：我今天看到一个非常奇怪的事情。",
      "traditional": "保羅：我今天看到一個非常奇怪的事情。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó wǒ jīn tiān kàn dào yì ge fēi cháng qí guài de shì qing",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Today I saw a very strange thing."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小乐：什么事情？",
      "traditional": "小樂：什麼事情？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè shén me shì qing",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: What thing?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "保罗：我看到有很多女人在河边用木棒打衣服。",
      "traditional": "保羅：我看到有很多女人在河邊用木棒打衣服。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó wǒ kàn dào yǒu hěn duō nǚ rén zài hé biān yòng mù bàng dǎ yī fu",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: I saw lots of women by the river bank using wooden sticks to beat clothes."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "小乐：她们那是在洗衣服。",
      "traditional": "小樂：她們那是在洗衣服。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè tā men nà shì zài xǐ yī fu",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: They’re washing clothes."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "保罗：洗衣服？为什么要用木棒？",
      "traditional": "保羅：洗衣服？為什麼要用木棒？",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó xǐ yī fu wèi shén me yào yòng mù bàng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Washing clothes? Why do they need to use wooden sticks?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "小乐：这是我们洗衣服的一种方式，用木棒可以把衣服里面的脏东西打出来。",
      "traditional": "小樂：這是我們洗衣服的一種方式，用木棒可以把衣服裡面的髒東西打出來。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè zhè shì wǒ men xǐ yī fu de yì zhǒng fāng shì yòng mù bàng kě yǐ bǎ yī fu lǐ miàn de zāng dōng xi dǎ chū lái",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "很久很久以前，还没有洗衣机的时候，大家都是用这种方式在河边洗衣服。",
      "traditional": "很久很久以前，還沒有洗衣機的時候，大家都是用這種方式在河邊洗衣服。",
      "pinyin": "hěn jiǔ hěn jiǔ yǐ qián hái méi yǒu xǐ yī jī de shí hou dà jiā dōu shì yòng zhè zhǒng fāng shì zài hé biān xǐ yī fu",
      "english": "Little Le: This is one way of washing clothes. Using a wooden stick can beat the dirt out of the clothes."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "现在城里人家家都有洗衣机，已经没有人用这种方式洗衣服了。",
      "traditional": "現在城裡人家家都有洗衣機，已經沒有人用這種方式洗衣服了。",
      "pinyin": "xiàn zài chéng lǐ rén jiā jiā dōu yǒu xǐ yī jī yǐ jīng méi yǒu rén yòng zhè zhǒng fāng shì xǐ yī fu le",
      "english": "A long time ago, before there were washing machines, everyone would wash clothes by the river bank this way."
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "但是在农村，有些地方还是用这种方式洗衣服。",
      "traditional": "但是在農村，有些地方還是用這種方式洗衣服。",
      "pinyin": "dàn shì zài nóng cūn yǒu xiē dì fang hái shi yòng zhè zhǒng fāng shì xǐ yī fu",
      "english": "Nowadays, every family in the city has a washing machine and no one washes clothes this way."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "But in rural areas, there are some places where people still wash clothes this way."
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "保罗：哈哈！真好玩儿！下次我也要试试“打”衣服。",
      "traditional": "保羅：哈哈！真好玩兒！下次我也要試試“打”衣服。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó hā hā zhēn hǎo wán‘r xià cì wǒ yě yào shì shi dǎ yī fu",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Ha ha! That’s so interesting! Next time I will also try “beating” my clothes."
    }
  ],
