    "sentence_translations": [
      "Beating clothes",
      "",
      "Paul: Today I saw a very strange thing.",
      "",
      "Little Le: What thing?",
      "",
      "Paul: I saw lots of women by the river bank using wooden sticks to beat clothes.",
      "",
      "Little Le: They’re washing clothes.",
      "",
      "Paul: Washing clothes? Why do they need to use wooden sticks?",
      "",
      "Little Le: This is one way of washing clothes. Using a wooden stick can beat the dirt out of the clothes.",
      "A long time ago, before there were washing machines, everyone would wash clothes by the river bank this way.",
      "Nowadays, every family in the city has a washing machine and no one washes clothes this way.",
      "But in rural areas, there are some places where people still wash clothes this way.",
      "",
      "Paul: Ha ha! That’s so interesting! Next time I will also try “beating” my clothes.",
      ""
